stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: inserted in booking transaction
    PENDING --> PROCESSED: version key bumped
    PENDING --> PENDING: Redis error, attempts <= 3,<br/>next_attempt_at = now() + 2s
    PENDING --> FAILED: 4th failure or invalid payload
    PROCESSED --> [*]: cleanup after 7 days
    FAILED --> [*]: cleanup after 30 days
